
## Creating gcloud storage buckets ##

# creates new "zc-dev-uss1-ff-hist" storage bucket (bucket name must be 
#  GLOBALLY unique) in dallas ("us-south1") with permissions controlled 
#  via IAM ("--uniform-bucket-level-access")

  gcloud storage buckets create gs://zc-dev-uss1-ff-hist --location=us-south1 --uniform-bucket-level-access

# view all storage buckets urls (uses Google Cloud account that machine is "signed into")
gcloud storage ls

